Package: canalysis
Type: Package
Title: Analyse UK Canal Networks Using OpenStreetMap Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Peter", "Owen",
      email = "peter@bzi.com.au",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Ranks UK cities by canal length, area coverage, and canal density
    within administrative boundaries. Downloads canal geometries and
    administrative polygons from OpenStreetMap, enriches them with official
    population estimates, and computes spatial metrics.
